# ignore files with no extention:
*
!*/
!*.*
!Makefile

# normal ignores:
*.exe
nimcache
*.pdb
*.ilk
*.out
.*

bin/*

# --- Copyright hygiene: never commit the game or its assets ---
# See AGENTS.md "Copyright hygiene" + docs/copyright-notes.md.
# ROM images (the copyrighted work). Anywhere in the tree, not just bin/.
*.smc
*.sfc
# Captured audio ripped from the ROM (music/SFX are copyrighted assets).
*.wav
# Emulator savestates / memory dumps (partial copies of the ROM).
*.state
*.savestate
# Root-level image captures (screenshots contain game graphics). Scoped to the
# repo root so docs/ can still hold legit diagram images.
/*.png
/*.bmp
# Curated, image-only README illustrations. Other captures stay local.
# See docs/images/README.md; verify PNG chunks before adding an image.
/docs/images/*
!/docs/images/README.md
!/docs/images/emulator.png
!/docs/images/earthbound_20260818-022023-ds.png
!/docs/images/music-jukebox.png
!/docs/images/battle-background-viewer.png
!/docs/images/bestiary.png
# Battery saves (player data, but keep them out of the repo anyway).
*.srm
# Build-time extraction output from the user's ROM (scripts/graphics/audio/etc.
# are copyrighted assets — extracted locally, never committed). Designated dir.
extracted/

# Kiosk captures contain game graphics, replays, and embedded machine states.
/captures/

# Auto-capture screenshots (play.nim F11) — contain game graphics.
bin/autoshots/
bin/sram_backups/

# Eval run logs may contain agent transcripts with on-screen dialogue
# (script content — banned). Scorecards themselves are committed; see
# runs/README.md and docs/EVAL.md.
runs/*/logs/
